{"orgCode":"1701","name":"Department of Financial Protection and Innovation","agencyCode":"1000","agencyName":"Business and Consumer Services","description":"The Department of Financial Protection and Innovation (Department) serves Californians by effectively overseeing financial service providers; enforcing laws and regulations; promoting innovation and fair and honest business practices; enhancing consumer awareness; and protecting consumers by preventing potential marketplace risks, fraud, and abuse.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":166843,"cy":179389,"by":182959},"positions":{"py":796,"cy":886.3,"by":886.3},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":582,"cy":1250,"by":1250},"nongovernmental":{"py":423,"cy":47,"by":0}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/1000/1701","kind":"department","name":"Department of Financial Protection and Innovation","code":"1701","amounts":{"py":166843,"cy":179389,"by":182959},"positions":{"py":796,"cy":886.3,"by":886.3},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0},"special":{"py":166181,"cy":179389,"by":182959}},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1510","kind":"program","name":"Investment Program","code":"1510","amounts":{"py":42970,"cy":43849,"by":44441},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":42970,"cy":43849,"by":44441}},"positions":{"py":200.5,"cy":235.8,"by":235.8},"description":"1510 - INVESTMENT PROGRAM\n\nThe objective of this program is to protect investors in securities, commodities, and franchise investment transactions and to promote capital formation in California. The program regulates the offer and sale of certain securities, franchises, and licenses and examines broker-dealers and investment advisers.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":43393,"cy":43896,"by":44441}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1510/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":42970,"cy":43849,"by":44441},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":42970,"cy":43849,"by":44441}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":42970,"cy":43849,"by":44441}}}}],"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1510/f0942","kind":"fund","name":"Special Deposit Fund","code":"0942","amounts":{"py":423,"cy":47,"by":0},"byFundType":{"nongovernmental":{"py":423,"cy":47,"by":0}},"extra":{"fundType":"nongovernmental","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":423,"cy":47,"by":0}}}}],"excluded":{"nongovernmental":{"py":423,"cy":47,"by":0}}},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1515","kind":"program","name":"Lender-Fiduciary Program","code":"1515","amounts":{"py":35072,"cy":36251,"by":36379},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":35072,"cy":36251,"by":36379}},"positions":{"py":164.9,"cy":190.7,"by":190.7},"description":"1515 - LENDER-FIDUCIDIARY\n\nThe objective of this program is to protect consumers who borrow and enter into financial transactions with lenders and fiduciaries licensed by the Department. The program licenses and regulates businesses engaged in financial transactions such as mortgage loan originators, finance lenders, escrow agents, deferred deposit originators, bill payers, proraters, residential mortgage lenders and servicers, and property assessed clean energy program administrators.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":35072,"cy":36251,"by":36379}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1515/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":35072,"cy":36251,"by":36379},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":35072,"cy":36251,"by":36379}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":35072,"cy":36251,"by":36379}}}}]},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1520","kind":"program","name":"Licensing and Supervision of Banks and Trust Companies","code":"1520","amounts":{"py":35348,"cy":35673,"by":35813},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0},"special":{"py":34686,"cy":35673,"by":35813}},"positions":{"py":165,"cy":191.4,"by":191.4},"description":"1520 - LICENSING AND SUPERVISION OF BANKS AND TRUST COMPANIES\n\nThe objective of this program is to promote the integrity and stability of state-licensed banks and trust companies, savings associations, student loan servicing, state-licensed business and industrial development corporations, and state-licensed public banks, industrial banks, and premium finance companies. This objective is achieved through the regulation, supervision, and examination of these institutions, which helps to provide their safe and sound operation and compliance with laws and regulations.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":35376,"cy":36573,"by":36713},"Local Assistance":{"py":354,"cy":0,"by":0}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1520/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":308,"cy":0,"by":0},"Local Assistance":{"py":354,"cy":0,"by":0}}}},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1520/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":34686,"cy":35673,"by":35813},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":34686,"cy":35673,"by":35813}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":34686,"cy":35673,"by":35813}}}}],"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1520/f0995","kind":"fund","name":"Reimbursements","code":"0995","amounts":{"py":382,"cy":900,"by":900},"byFundType":{"reimbursement":{"py":382,"cy":900,"by":900}},"extra":{"fundType":"reimbursement","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":382,"cy":900,"by":900}}}}],"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":382,"cy":900,"by":900}}},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1525","kind":"program","name":"Money Transmitters","code":"1525","amounts":{"py":6866,"cy":7140,"by":7164},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":6866,"cy":7140,"by":7164}},"positions":{"py":32.3,"cy":36.8,"by":36.8},"description":"1525 - MONEY TRANSMITTERS\n\nThe objective of this program is to promote the integrity and stability of businesses that receive money for transmission and sell or issue payment instruments and stored value. This objective is achieved through the regulation, supervision, and examination of these institutions, which helps provide their safe and sound operation and compliance with laws and regulations.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":6866,"cy":7140,"by":7164}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1525/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":6866,"cy":7140,"by":7164},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":6866,"cy":7140,"by":7164}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":6866,"cy":7140,"by":7164}}}}]},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1545","kind":"program","name":"Administration of Local Agency Security","code":"1545","amounts":{"py":453,"cy":568,"by":571},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":453,"cy":568,"by":571}},"positions":{"py":0.7,"cy":1.8,"by":1.8},"description":"1545 - ADMINISTRATION OF LOCAL AGENCY SECURITY\n\nThe objective of this program is to monitor the amount and quality of collateral pledged in compliance with law to secure deposits of public funds held by banks, savings and loans, industrial banks, credit unions, and federally chartered financial institutions.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":453,"cy":568,"by":571}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1545/f0240","kind":"fund","name":"Local Agency Deposit Security Fund","code":"0240","amounts":{"py":453,"cy":568,"by":571},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":453,"cy":568,"by":571}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":453,"cy":568,"by":571}}}}]},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1550","kind":"program","name":"Credit Unions","code":"1550","amounts":{"py":13991,"cy":14549,"by":14607},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":13991,"cy":14549,"by":14607}},"positions":{"py":67.4,"cy":76.9,"by":76.9},"description":"1550 - CREDIT UNIONS\n\nThe objective of this program is to promote the integrity and stability of state-licensed credit unions. This objective is achieved through the regulation, supervision, and examination of these institutions, which helps to provide their safe and sound operation and compliance with laws and regulations.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":14191,"cy":14899,"by":14957}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1550/f0299","kind":"fund","name":"Credit Union Fund","code":"0299","amounts":{"py":13991,"cy":14549,"by":14607},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":13991,"cy":14549,"by":14607}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":13991,"cy":14549,"by":14607}}}}],"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1550/f0995","kind":"fund","name":"Reimbursements","code":"0995","amounts":{"py":200,"cy":350,"by":350},"byFundType":{"reimbursement":{"py":200,"cy":350,"by":350}},"extra":{"fundType":"reimbursement","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":200,"cy":350,"by":350}}}}],"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":200,"cy":350,"by":350}}},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1555","kind":"program","name":"CalMoneySmart","code":"1555","amounts":{"py":2064,"cy":2340,"by":2340},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":2064,"cy":2340,"by":2340}},"positions":{"py":1,"cy":1,"by":1},"description":"1555 - CALMONEY SMART\n\nThis program provides grants to specified nonprofits for financial education and empowerment services to unbanked and underbanked populations in this state.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":128,"cy":340,"by":340},"Local Assistance":{"py":1936,"cy":2000,"by":2000}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1555/f3360","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Empowerment Fund","code":"3360","amounts":{"py":2064,"cy":2340,"by":2340},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":2064,"cy":2340,"by":2340}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":128,"cy":340,"by":340},"Local Assistance":{"py":1936,"cy":2000,"by":2000}}}}]},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1556","kind":"program","name":"California Consumer Financial Protection","code":"1556","amounts":{"py":13096,"cy":14341,"by":15569},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":13096,"cy":14341,"by":15569}},"positions":{"py":69.4,"cy":49.5,"by":49.5},"description":"1556 - CALIFORNIA CONSUMER FINANCIAL PROTECTION\n\nThe objectives of this program are to expand consumer financial protection against illegal, deceptive, or unscrupulous practices through the supervision of certain financial product and service providers not previously regulated by the Department prior to January 1, 2021; market monitoring and research; consumer outreach and education; and to encourage innovative financial products.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":13096,"cy":14341,"by":15569}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1556/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":13096,"cy":14341,"by":15569},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":13096,"cy":14341,"by":15569}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":13096,"cy":14341,"by":15569}}}}]},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1557","kind":"program","name":"Debt Collectors","code":"1557","amounts":{"py":11800,"cy":13056,"by":14543},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":11800,"cy":13056,"by":14543}},"positions":{"py":72.5,"cy":61.4,"by":61.4},"description":"1557 - DEBT COLLECTORS\n\nThe objective of this program is to protect consumers and ensure transparency of the debt collector industry through strong government oversight and data collection. This objective is achieved through the regulation, supervision, and examination of debt collectors, which helps provide compliance with laws and regulations.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":11800,"cy":13056,"by":14543}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1557/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":11800,"cy":13056,"by":14543},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":11800,"cy":13056,"by":14543}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":11800,"cy":13056,"by":14543}}}}]},{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1558","kind":"program","name":"Digital Financial Assets","code":"1558","amounts":{"py":5183,"cy":11622,"by":11532},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":5183,"cy":11622,"by":11532}},"positions":{"py":22.3,"cy":41,"by":41},"description":"1558 - DIGITAL FINANCIAL ASSETS\n\nThe objective of this program is to establish a licensing and regulatory framework for digital financial asset business activity. This objective is achieved through the regulation, supervision, and examination of licensees.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":5183,"cy":11622,"by":11532}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/1558/f3363","kind":"fund","name":"Financial Protection Fund","code":"3363","amounts":{"py":5183,"cy":11622,"by":11532},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":5183,"cy":11622,"by":11532}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":5183,"cy":11622,"by":11532}}}}]}],"sources":[{"label":"ebudget.ca.gov API: orgProgram/1701","url":"https://ebudget.ca.gov/api/budget/e/2026-27/orgProgram/1701"},{"label":"Detailed Expenditures by Program (PDF)","url":"https://ebudget.ca.gov/2026-27/pdf/Enacted/GovernorsBudget/1000/1701.pdf"}],"extra":{"legalCitations":"DEPARTMENT AUTHORITY\n\nCalifornia Financial Code, Division 1, Chapter 3.\n\nPROGRAM AUTHORITY\n\n1510-Investment Program: California Corporations Code, Title 4, Divisions 1, 2 , 2.5, 3, 4, 4.5, and 5; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 260.000-260.617, 280.100-280.700, and 310.002-310.505.\n\n1515-Lender-Fiduciary Program: California Financial Code, Divisions 1.4, 1.7, 1.10, 3, 6, 9, 9.5, 10, 14, and 20; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 900-956, 1404-1620.29, 1700-1769, 1775-1799, 1805.001-1805.213.1, 1950.003-1950.317, and 2020-2030.5.\n\n1520-Licensing and Supervision of Banks and Trust Companies: California Financial Code, Divisions 1, 1.1, 1.5 , 1.6, 1.8 , 1.9, 1.10 , 2, 7, 12.5, and 15; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 10.1-10.190501, 40.1-40.1703, 50.1-50.15309, 95.1-95.5030,100.100-110.214, and 2032-2044.5.\n\n1525-Money Transmitters: California Financial Code, Division 1.2; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 80.1-80.8310.\n\n1545-Administration of Local Agency Security: California Government Code, Title 5, Division 2; Title 2, California Code of Regulations, Sections 16001.1.1-16010.1.3.\n\n1550-Credit Unions: California Financial Code, Divisions 1.5, 1.9, 1.10, 5; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 30.1-30.1001.\n\n1555-CalMoneySmart: California Financial Code, Division 10.5.\n\n1556-California Consumer Financial Protection: California Financial Code, Division 24; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 1000-1062.\n\n1557-Debt Collectors: California Financial Code, Division 25; Title 10, California Code of Regulations, Sections 1850-1850.70.\n\n1558-Digital Financial Assets Businesses: California Financial Code, Division 1.25."},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":582,"cy":1250,"by":1250},"nongovernmental":{"py":423,"cy":47,"by":0}}},"funding":{"id":"exp/1000/1701/funding","kind":"root","name":"Department of Financial Protection and Innovation: Funding by fund and appropriation","amounts":{"py":166843,"cy":179389,"by":182959},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0},"special":{"py":166181,"cy":179389,"by":182959}},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/funding/general","kind":"fundType","name":"General Fund","code":"general","amounts":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0}},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1701/fund/0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":662,"cy":0,"by":0